  "bodyHash": "ypLvCoBL1rg=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/851578817761045424-scuba-gear.png\" alt=\"undefined\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5PMReeE\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/223938153260515328.svg?color=7289DA&amp;label=discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 伺服器\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweblate.moddinglegacy.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/translate-weblate-2ECCAA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=weblate&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"幫助打破語言障礙，在 Weblate 上翻譯 Scuba Gear！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"如果你喜歡我們的作品，請考慮在 Ko-fi 上支持我們！謝謝！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/BUILT_WITH-NEOFORGE-d7742f?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=neoforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"使用 NeoForge 構建\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/ModdingLegacy?style=social\" alt=\"關注我們！ModdingLegacy Twitter\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fmoddinglegacy.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/moddinglegacy.com-0285FF?logo=bluesky&amp;logoColor=00&amp;style=social\" alt=\"關注我們！moddinglegacy.com Bluesky\"> </a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/channel/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ?sub_confirmation=1&amp;style=social&amp;label=@ModdingLegacy\" alt=\"在 YouTube 上訂閱我們！\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-style:italic;text-align:center;font-weight:600\">一個簡單的模組，增加了一些有用的水中潛水裝備。</p><hr><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🤿 取得方式</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">在海洋廢墟周圍 15 格內的沉屍有機會帶著這些裝備生成，其中某些部件比其他部件更稀有。從最常見到最稀有依序是：頭盔（50%）、靴子（40%）、護腿（30%）和胸甲（20%）。如果沉屍確實帶著裝備生成，它會依序擁有所有前面的部件。所以如果一隻沉屍帶著潛水護腿生成，那它也必定會有靴子和頭盔。</p><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🐟 能力與功能</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">每個裝備部件都有不同的能力。除此之外，當穿戴者在水中時，每穿戴一個部件，移動速度會略微降低，其中胸甲和頭盔的影響最大。使用時，護甲每 4 秒會受到一次耐久度損耗，所以請務必注意耐久度！（此效果僅適用於玩家，不影響其他穿戴的實體。）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-size:1.5em\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/215738475645434530-scuba_helmet.png\" alt=\"頭盔\" width=\"32\"> 頭盔</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">頭盔賦予穿戴者水下呼吸能力。</p><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-size:1.5em\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/113135684801467354-scuba_chestplate.png\" alt=\"胸甲\" width=\"32\"> 胸甲</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">胸甲允許穿戴者在水下以接近正常速度挖掘。當挖掘疲勞效果啟用時，此能力不會生效。</p><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-size:1.5em\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/073127807132382716-scuba_leggings.png\" alt=\"護腿\" width=\"32\"> 護腿</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">護腿允許穿戴者在游泳時獲得微幅的速度提升。這不影響步行速度。</p><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-size:1.5em\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/221266075812152127-scuba_boots.png\" alt=\"靴子\" width=\"32\"> 靴子</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">靴子允許穿戴者在水下更快地行走。這不影響游泳速度。</p><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/306/77/player.png\" alt=\"潛水套裝\"></p><h3 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">全套套裝</h3><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">全套裝備提供一個額外的小獎勵：火焰抗性。不過，穿戴者不會受到傷害，而是由護甲來承受。護甲大約每秒會受到兩次損耗，所以請非常謹慎地使用此能力！</p><h3 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">屬性</h3><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">每個部件的耐久度和防禦力都與鐵製護甲相同。所以穿上它並不會犧牲太多。它也具有與鐵相同的附魔能力。</p><h3 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">修復</h3><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">當你獲得這套護甲時，它很可能已經嚴重受損。你可以使用鐵在合成台或鐵砧上以傳統方式修復它。當然，修補附魔也有效。</p><hr><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">試試看 Scuba Gear 的姐妹模組 Miner's Helmet！</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miners-helmet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/290/102/637317604265655624.png\" alt=\"礦工頭盔\" width=\"128\"></a></p><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\"><strong>你想要一頂能在洞穴、水中、地獄以及任何地方照亮前路的頭盔嗎？試試 Scuba Gear 的姐妹模組 Miner's Helmet！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miners-helmet\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡查看專案。</a></strong></p><hr><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🤷 常見問題 FAQ</h2><h3 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">我可以在我的模組包中使用這個模組嗎？</h3><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">是的，當然可以。只需確保正確標示所有作者的貢獻，並連結回 CurseForge 頁面即可。</p><h3 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">我可以在其他平台上重新發布這個模組嗎？</h3><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">可以，但在這樣做之前，請確保所有下載連結都直接指向 CurseForge，並標示所有作者的貢獻。</p><hr><h2 style=\"display:inline;color:#5abbae;font-family:Palatino Linotype, cursive;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🌐 翻譯 Scuba Gear - 幫助打破語言障礙！</h2><p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">所有翻譯者都在此處列出。感謝所有幫助這個模組變得更容易使用的人！</p><p><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/southafrica.png\" alt=\"Flag for Afrikaans (Suid-Afrika)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>南非荷蘭文（南非）翻譯者：Anita</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/saudiarabia.png\" alt=\"Flag for اللغة العربية (alLuġah al'Arabiyye)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>阿拉伯語（اللغة العربية）翻譯者：Ahmed</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/azerbaijan.png\" alt=\"Flag for Azərbaycanca (Azərbaycan)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>亞塞拜然語（亞塞拜然）翻譯者：Esmira</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/belarus.png\" alt=\"Flag for Беларуская (Беларусь)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>白俄羅斯語（白俄羅斯）翻譯者：PinkGoose</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/bulgaria.png\" alt=\"Flag for Български (България)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>保加利亞語（保加利亞）翻譯者：Assia</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"Flag for Català (Catalunya)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>加泰隆尼亞語（加泰隆尼亞）翻譯者：Laura</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/unitedkingdom.png\" alt=\"Flag for Cymraeg (Cymru)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>威爾斯語（威爾斯）翻譯者：Fl3x_X_Placid</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/unitedkingdom.png\" alt=\"Flag for English (United Kingdom)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>英文（英國）翻譯者：AncientCreaturesDeveliper</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/mexico.png\" alt=\"Flag for Español (México)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙文（墨西哥）翻譯者：Vamacheron</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/estonia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Eesti (Eesti)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>愛沙尼亞語（愛沙尼亞）翻譯者：Airi</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/iran.png\" alt=\"Flag for فارسی (Fārsiy)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>波斯語（فارسی）翻譯者：Omrani</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/finland.png\" alt=\"Flag for Suomi (Suomi)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>芬蘭語（芬蘭）翻譯者：Jari</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/philippines.png\" alt=\"Fla