rea.png\" alt=\"Flag for 한국어 (Hangugeo)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>韓語（한국어）翻譯者：mekayusina</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/lithuania.png\" alt=\"Flag for Lietuvių\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>立陶宛語翻譯者：Kristina</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/latvia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Latviešu (Latvija)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>拉脫維亞語（拉脫維亞）翻譯者：Andrejs</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/northmacedonia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Македонски (Makedonski)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>馬其頓語（Македонски）翻譯者：Milena</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/malaysia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Bahasa Melayu (Malaysia)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>馬來語（馬來西亞）翻譯者：Haikal</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/norway.png\" alt=\"Flag for Norsk nynorsk (Norge)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>挪威尼諾斯克語（挪威）翻譯者：Marie</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/norway.png\" alt=\"Flag for Norsk Bokmål (Norge)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>挪威博克馬爾語（挪威）翻譯者：Marie</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/brazil.png\" alt=\"Flag for Português (Brasil)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>葡萄牙文（巴西）翻譯者：Mikeliro, Kahina</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/portugal.png\" alt=\"Flag for Português (Portugal)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>葡萄牙文（葡萄牙）翻譯者：Criogonal</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/russia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Русский (Russkiy)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>俄語（Русский）翻譯者：PinkGoose</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/slovakia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Slovenčina (Slovensko)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>斯洛伐克語（斯洛伐克）翻譯者：Juraj</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/slovenia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Slovenščina (Slovenija)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>斯洛維尼亞語（斯洛維尼亞）翻譯者：Jaka</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/sweden.png\" alt=\"Flag for Svenska (Sverige)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>瑞典語（瑞典）翻譯者：pomfu</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/thailand.png\" alt=\"Flag for ไทย (thay)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>泰語（ไทย）翻譯者：Supanat</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/turkey.png\" alt=\"Flag for Türkçe (Türkiye)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>土耳其語（土耳其）翻譯者：ygzbys</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/ukraine.png\" alt=\"Flag for Українська (Ukrayins'ka)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>烏克蘭語（Українська）翻譯者：PinkGoose</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/vietnam.png\" alt=\"Flag for Tiếng Việt (Việt Nam)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>越南語（Việt Nam）翻譯者：Tran Q</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/china.png\" alt=\"Flag for 简体中文（中国大陆）\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>簡體中文（中國大陸）翻譯者：Imbarainbow</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/taiwan.png\" alt=\"Flag for 繁體中文（台灣）\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>繁體中文（台灣）翻譯者：Kyle</strong> </span></p><hr><p style=\"color:#f00;font-size:2.5em\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-size:1.1em;line-height:1em\"><strong>🤚 支援：如果您對我們的模組有任何問題或疑問，請先閱讀常見問題集！您也可以在問題追蹤器上提交問題，或加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，我們將為您提供協助！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5PMReeE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>",
